OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Bishop of Aberdeen dies
OL,4,Aaged 91
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Catholic Bishop of Aberdeen,
OL,7,Fthe Right Reverend Peter Moran, has
OL,8,Fdied at the age of 91.
OL,10,FThe Diocese of Aberdeen announced that
OL,11,FBishop Emeritus Moran died on Friday
OL,12,Fmorning at Northcote Lodge Care Home in
OL,13,FAberdeen, where he had lived in recent
OL,14,Fyears.
OL,16,FHe led the diocese for nearly eight
OL,17,Fyears, serving from his ordination as
OL,18,Fbishop in December 2003 until his
OL,19,Fretirement in August 2011.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
